'''Commander Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained by beating [[Fascinating Fallen Tower/Floor 20|Floor 20]] of the [[Fascinating Fallen Tower]]. She was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

